# Ship on main

Commit and push Segmiq work to `main` only.

- Do not commit or push to feature branches, preview branches, or any branch other than `main`.
- If the checkout is not `main`, put the change on `main` before pushing.
- Push to `origin main` after the commit. Do not force-push `main`.
